# SCYPHEON: AI Access Policy
# This file overrides or supplements .gitignore for AI agents (Antigravity, Gemini, etc.)
# Established per Enterprise Architecture & Security Guidelines (AGENTS.md)

# Global - Only allow metadata by default (inherits from .gitignore intent)
# But here we explicitly whitelist what is safe for LLM context.

# Root whitelists
!AGENTS.md
!README.md
!LICENSE

# === VITREON: Edge Android & C++ Engine ===

# Unblock the local-llama C++ source directory for architectural analysis and development
# This allows the AI to understand the core inference engine without unblocking the entire repo.
!VITREON/llama/src/main/cpp/local-llama/**

# Explicit whitelists for files reported as blocked in current session
!VITREON/llama/src/main/cpp/local-llama/ggml/src/ggml-vulkan/vulkan-shaders/mul_mat_vec_base.glsl
!VITREON/llama/src/main/cpp/local-llama/AGENTS.md

# Optional: Add other critical source areas as needed
# !VITREON/app/src/main/java/com/scypheon/vitreon/**
